    "Check thresholds are the domed-sticker values from the Print MCP spec; other sticker types may need their own.",
    "sheet_in (9.25 x 10 in) is confirmed only for domed sheets (current studio + spec).",
    "white_prints_clear on Metallic and white_ink on Clear follow the product names; confirm with production.",
    "Vinyl lettering is cut from solid-color vinyl (one color, text and vector only), based on the product name 'Cut Vinyl Logos'; confirm with production."
